# Build cache directory.
#
# scripts/build_installer.ps1 pulls a fresh OllamaSetup.exe from
# https://ollama.com/download/OllamaSetup.exe into this folder before
# invoking ISCC. It's gitignored (see .gitignore: installer/embedded/*.exe)
# so the ~1 GB binary stays out of the repo.
#
# This .gitkeep keeps the directory tracked.
